This directory contains an unmodified copy of the generic model fallback
instructions from OpenAI Codex (codex-rs/models-manager/prompt.md).
These are the official BASE_INSTRUCTIONS used in fallback model descriptors
for unknown model slugs. OCG includes them explicitly because the custom
catalog parser requires an instruction source for every model entry.
This package does not bundle the Codex client or any other Codex sources.

